## Vercel Web Analytics - Implementation Status

### Summary
Vercel Web Analytics is **already installed and properly configured** in this project. No changes were necessary as the implementation already follows the latest best practices from the official Vercel documentation.

### Current Implementation

**Package Installation:**
- `@vercel/analytics` version 2.0.1 is installed in package.json
- Package dependencies are up to date

**Configuration:**
- Location: `website/app/layout.tsx` (Next.js App Router)
- Implementation follows the official quickstart guide instructions
- Analytics component is correctly imported from `@vercel/analytics/next`
- Component is placed at the end of the `<body>` tag as recommended

**Code Details:**
```typescript
import { Analytics } from "@vercel/analytics/next";

export default function RootLayout({ children }: { children: React.ReactNode }) {
  return (
    <html lang="en">
      <head>
        {/* ... */}
      </head>
      <body>
        {children}
        {/* ... */}
        {/* Vercel Web Analytics: visitor counts, no cookies. */}
        <Analytics />
      </body>
    </html>
  );
}
```

